# Optional per-project Jira / notify secrets. Copy to .secrets/jira.env (gitignored).
#
# --- Teams UX pass notifications (optional) ---
# Power Automate webhook when an Athena UX pass starts (Hephaestus kick or charter).
# Use the SAME URL as Hephaestus DEV_FACTORY_TEAMS_WEBHOOK_URL for the same Teams channel.
# ALWAYS QUOTE the value: it contains `&`, and an unquoted value is truncated to empty.
# UX_FACTORY_TEAMS_WEBHOOK_URL="https://....powerplatform.com/.../invoke?api-version=1&sp=...&sig=..."
# Fallbacks if UX_FACTORY_TEAMS_WEBHOOK_URL unset: AGENT_TEAMS_WEBHOOK_URL, DEV_FACTORY_TEAMS_WEBHOOK_URL
# Smoke: bash scripts/test_pass_notify.sh <slug>
